### Key Metrics to Track

| Metric | Target | Alert Threshold |
|--------|--------|-----------------|
| Deployment Success Rate | > 99% | < 95% |
| Average Deployment Time | < 10 min | > 20 min |
| Rollback Frequency | < 5%/month | > 10%/month |
| Backup Success Rate | 100% | < 99.5% |
| RTO (Recovery Time) | < 1 hour | > 2 hours |
| RPO (Data Loss) | < 5 minutes | > 15 minutes |
